<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes continue in the disputed Abyei border region, with Sudanese forces attacking markets and killing dozens of civilians while denying involvement and blaming the RSF. Communal clashes between SSPDF and SPLA-IO forces have escalated in Lakes state, resulting in further fatalities. Police in Juba have arrested members of the Lologo gang and are investigating the killing of a central bank worker. The new UNMISS head has urged global unity to secure South Sudan's political pathway and the U.S. Embassy has remembered employees who died supporting the people. 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1Zc0dVWGU2SlJTeDhZYk12X1ZGWGpGVzJVYVFEckpRMjk4clY0SDZobE4zLU5oMzhoQXRXSWFUX2xyLVVfRFlyVGFVb2ctTVdmWHY3aE4wVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTkZja2JVNUJZenJ5Wlg3cEVkWVkzQkZvSmN5WmVoOXUwVG5kbW0zcExRdHIwYm5NWDJhNDlOcXpnWGpxZm5RbDJrU2hxTFVRVzJCZGVnYW1MVVFDU0tmZHB6S2tRWFNObWZSa0tQNnphSjJseWM4X3BrSDR0b0F6Vlp4OVU1aUJBNXVZaG1uZzZnWDY4d3VqNl9NbTUzeUxraUktMkNxbDVibTd0bTJ6cnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBMeUpzRjhmaTFnempZX0RSYTNPWl9wUVJITWlkTlhFQm11WjJjYWkxSmFrTVJNQUVvRVh4WFdXb2VVelRYQTA5cUVINUtOREV6UFRjeTNldDFxdHp5WEhVMDVlbk0?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOYno1UlFqU09OZUtvUVVGcWhWY0VUaEJhY3VEYk9HZ1VTMmdMb3RvMk9oNlBnUm9PaFMtU1Q3Sy1IcW5aTWdaUklQVXlRa0FHTmFBSUpqMU5JSllNQVpSNk1ObFk2MWxmNzRBMy1kOE5tMnVWN1dRdnd6W